# Citation metadata for this repository.
#
# Two levels are described here on purpose:
#   * the top-level block describes this repository's companion code, and
#   * `preferred-citation` is the paper this code implements.
#
# GitHub renders `preferred-citation` for "Cite this repository", which is what we
# want: the paper is the citable artefact, not this code.
#
# NOTE on `license`: this repository carries NO license (the upstream
# wcleithinking/PI-STR-for-Quadrotor had no LICENSE file either), so the field is
# deliberately absent. Do not add `license:` here until a license has actually been
# granted in writing -- see docs/licensing.md.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the model it contains, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "PI-STR for Quadrotor"
abstract: >-
  Firmware (Arduino Due), a MATLAB study and a Python 3D simulator for a quadrotor
  tracking controller that combines an outer PI loop with an inner self-tuning
  regulator: recursive least squares identifies a discrete ARX model of the rate
  channel online and pole placement retunes the inner loop from the identified model.
keywords:
  - quadrotor
  - self-tuning regulator
  - adaptive control
  - pole placement
  - recursive least squares
  - flight control
  - Arduino Due
authors:
  - family-names: Lei
    given-names: Wenchao
    email: wcleithinking@gmail.com
    alias: wcleithinking
    website: "https://github.com/wcleithinking"
repository-code: "https://github.com/wcleithinking/PI-STR-for-Quadrotor"
url: "https://github.com/wcleithinking/PI-STR-for-Quadrotor"
# No `date-released`: this repository mixes the 2018 original code (last upstream
# commit 2018-07-09) with later refactoring work, so a single date would be wrong.
references:
  - type: article
    title: >-
      Robust Adaptive Tracking Control for Quadrotors by Combining PI and
      Self-Tuning Regulator
    authors:
      - family-names: Lei
        given-names: Wenchao
      - family-names: Li
        given-names: Chanying
      - family-names: Chen
        given-names: "Michael Z. Q."
    journal: "IEEE Transactions on Control Systems Technology"
    volume: 27
    issue: 6
    start: 2663
    end: 2671
    year: 2019
    month: 11
    doi: "10.1109/TCST.2018.2872462"
    url: "https://doi.org/10.1109/TCST.2018.2872462"
